  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till Medyascope 2017</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Medyascope 2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den planerade utvecklingsinsatsen syftar till att st&#xF6;tta oberoende informationsspridning  i Turkiet f&#xF6;r att bidra till &#xF6;kad mediapluralism i landet. P&#xE5; s&#xE5; vis ses insatsen vara ett st&#xF6;d till &#xF6;kad yttrandefrihet och ambassaden bed&#xF6;mer att insatsen p&#xE5; sikt kan bidra till &#xF6;kat ansvarsutkr&#xE4;vande g&#xE4;llande yttrandefrihet och demokrati. Det planerade svenska st&#xF6;det till Medyascope.tv bereds som ett projektst&#xF6;d utifr&#xE5;n syftet att st&#xF6;tta organisationens k&#xE4;rnverksamhet s&#xE5; att den kan fortl&#xF6;pa under r&#xE5;dande omst&#xE4;ndigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The planned contribution aims to support dissemination of independent information in Turkey through support to independent media to enable a pluralistic environment of available independent information. The contribution is therefore supporting freedom of expression and the Embassy assesses that it in time can contribute to increased accountability regarding freedom of expression and democracy. The planned Swedish support to Medyascope.tv is made through a project-grant with the aim to support Medyascope&#x2019;s core activities so that the media platform can continue to undertake its work under the current circumstances.</narrative>
  </description>
